  "explanation": {
    "md_es": "**Ropa:** shirt · T-shirt · trousers · jeans · dress · skirt · jacket · coat · shoes · socks · hat\n\n**wear** = llevar puesto: *She wears a dress.* (no *use*)\n\n**Plurales de pares:** *trousers, jeans, shoes, socks* siempre van en plural: *My jeans are blue.* Para uno solo: *a pair of jeans / trousers / shoes*.\n\n**Mayoría de la ropa** va antes del color: *blue jeans, a white T-shirt.*",
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I use jeans.",
        "right": "I wear jeans.",
        "note": "Para ropa se usa wear."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "a trousers",
        "right": "a pair of trousers",
        "note": "Trousers, jeans y shoes son plurales."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
